Core [LinkML](https://linkml.io/) schema definitions needed to enable use of [yaml-datastore](https://github.com/dof-initiative/yaml-datastore) in [m30ml](https://github.com/dof-initiative/m30ml) projects.

Core features:

* yaml-datastore compatible primitive string types (e.g., simple and complex strings)
* yaml-datastore compatible primitive slot types (e.g., ids)
* schema building reference sheet for yaml-datastore